# The booking server's data file. It holds real customer names, addresses and
# phone numbers, and it must never end up in version control.
#
# The leading slash matters: `data/` with no slash matches a directory of that
# name at ANY depth, which silently excluded `src/data/` — the entire content
# layer of the site — from the repository. Anchored to the root, it means only
# the one directory it was written for.
/data/
*.bookings.json
